Frequency: Per project
Volume: PV modules, inverters, mounting, BESS, monitoring per site
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Procurement (links to VS-03), EPC, Quality (links to VS-31), Vendor
Source: workflow W3453 — Equipment Procurement, PV/Inverter/BESS Specification &amp; Quality</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3453_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3453_Lane1" name="Energy Manager">
