      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3453_Start5" name="EPC contract (W3452); own-procurement model">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3453_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3453_Task6" name="Energy Manager/EPC specify the equipment: PV module (tier-1, wattage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Energy Manager/EPC specify the equipment: PV module (tier-1, wattage, efficiency, warranty), inverter (string/central/micro, efficiency, monitoring), mounting/racking, BESS (chemistry, capacity, cycle life), cabling/protection, and monitoring/SCADA; ensure compatibility and code compliance
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / EPC
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3453_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3453_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3453_Task7" name="Procurement/EPC procure the equipment: vendor selection (links to VS-03)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procurement/EPC procure the equipment: vendor selection (links to VS-03), import/customs for imported equipment (links to VS-02.2/VS-87 incl. duty-free/incentive), quality inspection (links to VS-31) on receipt, and warranty/serial capture; manage lead times vs project schedule
Responsible (R): Procurement / EPC / Quality
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3453_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3453_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3453_Task8" name="Quality/Energy Manager verify equipment authenticity (anti-counterfeit links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quality/Energy Manager verify equipment authenticity (anti-counterfeit links to VS-71), factory/acceptance testing, serial/BOM capture for asset register (links to VS-35/W399) and warranty, and handoff to construction (W3454); resolve defects
Responsible (R): Quality / Energy Manager
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3453_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3453_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3453_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
