        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-553 (ensure controlled execution — Renewable Generation Investment, Capex &amp; Project Development (PA-108.1).) | - operational: tier-1 spec and anti-counterfeit (links to VS-71); operational: procurement planning and buffer
Owner: Energy Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
