    <bpmn:process id="W_W3454" name="W3454. Construction, Commissioning, Testing &amp; Asset Acceptance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Equipment ready (W3453); EPC schedule
Frequency: Per project
Volume: ~10–30 commissionings/year
Owner: Project Manager
Participants: Project Manager, Energy Manager, EPC, Facilities (links to VS-20.3), HSE (links to VS-24), DU/Inspector
Source: workflow W3454 — Construction, Commissioning, Testing &amp; Asset Acceptance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3454_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3454_Lane1" name="EPC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3454_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3454_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3454_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3454_Lane2" name="Project Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3454_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3454_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3454_Start4" name="Equipment ready (W3453); EPC schedule">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3454_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3454_Task5" name="EPC/Project Manager execute construction safely: site mobilization, structural…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EPC/Project Manager execute construction safely: site mobilization, structural works/mounting, module/inverter/BESS installation, DC/AC works, SCADA/monitoring, and HSE compliance (links to VS-24); coordinate with live store/DC operations (links to VS-07/VS-04) to minimize disruption
Responsible (R): EPC / Project Manager / HSE
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3454_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3454_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3454_Task6" name="EPC/Energy Manager commission and test: pre-energization checks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EPC/Energy Manager commission and test: pre-energization checks, interconnection with DU (links to W3462), performance/ratio test, yield verification vs spec, SCADA validation, and safety/protection testing; DU/electrical inspection and energization permit (links to VS-22)
Responsible (R): EPC / Energy Manager / DU
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3454_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3454_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3454_Task7" name="Project Manager/Energy Manager conduct asset acceptance: punch-list closure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Project Manager/Energy Manager conduct asset acceptance: punch-list closure, performance acceptance vs guarantee (W3452), documentation handover (as-built, O&amp;M manual, warranties, serials), and handover to operations (W3456); capture lessons
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Energy Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3454_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3454_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3454_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3454_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-553 (ensure controlled execution — Renewable Generation Investment, Capex &amp; Project Development (PA-108.1).) | - operational: performance test and LD (W3452); operational: under-performs guarantee; operational: HSE controls (links to VS-24)
Owner: Project Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
