    <bpmn:process id="W_W3455" name="W3455. Ownership-Model Selection: Own / Lease / PPA / RECOA Structuring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business case (W3451); portfolio strategy (W3449)
Frequency: Per project + portfolio
Volume: Per site
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, Treasury (links to VS-18), Tax (links to VS-79), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Energy Manager, Sustainability (links to VS-25)
Source: workflow W3455 — Ownership-Model Selection: Own / Lease / PPA / RECOA Structuring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3455_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3455_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3455_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3455_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3455_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3455_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3455_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3455_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3455_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3455_Start5" name="Business case (W3451); portfolio strategy (W3449)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3455_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3455_Task6" name="Treasury/Finance evaluate ownership models: own-and-operate (capex…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Treasury/Finance evaluate ownership models: own-and-operate (capex, depreciation, ITC/incentive capture, PFRS 16 n/a), operating lease / PPA (third-party owns/sells kWh, off-balance-sheet, PFRS 16 ROU if lease), or RECOA/solar-services; model economics, accounting, tax, and ESG-attribute ownership (REC links to W3465) per model
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3455_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3455_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3455_Task7" name="Legal/Treasury structure and document the chosen model: PPA (price, term…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Treasury structure and document the chosen model: PPA (price, term, availability, buy-out), lease (term, rent, ROU accounting links to VS-17/W275), or own-capex (links to VS-40); ensure regulatory compliance (ERC, DU, RE Act), incentive capture, and ESG-attribute ownership
Responsible (R): Legal / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3455_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3455_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3455_Task8" name="Finance/Tax lock the accounting treatment (PFRS 16 ROU, asset recognition…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Tax lock the accounting treatment (PFRS 16 ROU, asset recognition, incentive accounting, asset-retirement obligation links to VS-35), and integrate to financial reporting (links to VS-17) and ESG disclosure (links to VS-25.3/W192); document for audit (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3455_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3455_End9" name="Complete">
