    <bpmn:process id="W_W3456" name="W3456. Renewable Asset Registration, Capitalization &amp; Handover to Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Asset acceptance (W3454)
Frequency: Per project
Volume: Per site
Owner: Energy Manager
Participants: Energy Manager, Fixed Asset (links to VS-35), Finance (links to VS-17), Facilities/O&amp;M (links to VS-20.3), Master Data (links to VS-29)
Source: workflow W3456 — Renewable Asset Registration, Capitalization &amp; Handover to Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3456_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3456_Lane1" name="Fixed Asset">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3456_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3456_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3456_Lane2" name="Energy Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3456_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3456_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3456_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3456_Start4" name="Asset acceptance (W3454)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3456_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3456_Task5" name="Fixed Asset/Energy Manager register the renewable asset: asset tag, location…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fixed Asset/Energy Manager register the renewable asset: asset tag, location (links to W254/W16), componentization (PV array, inverter, BESS, mounting, SCADA), capex/cost capture, useful life, depreciation method, asset-retirement obligation (links to VS-35), and warranty/serial linkage (W3453)
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset / Energy Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3456_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3456_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3456_Task6" name="Energy Manager establish the operations baseline: rated capacity, expected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Energy Manager establish the operations baseline: rated capacity, expected generation, performance ratio, interconnection/net-metering registration status (W3462), monitoring/SCADA access, O&amp;M plan and vendor, and KPI targets; load into the energy/asset management system
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Facilities
Accountable (A): Energy Manager
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3456_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3456_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3456_Task7" name="Energy Manager formally hand over the asset to operations (PA-108.2), train…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Energy Manager formally hand over the asset to operations (PA-108.2), train facility/O&amp;M staff, activate monitoring/alerting, and confirm the asset is generating and settling (net-metering links to W3463); close the project and capture lessons (links to W3472)
Responsible (R): Energy Manager / Facilities
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3456_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3456_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3456_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3456_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-135 (ensure renewable asset registration &amp; net-metering settlement.) | - operational: FA registration discipline (links to VS-35); operational: formal handover and O&amp;M assignment
Owner: Energy Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
